  promptText: {fileID: 1295281264515738810}
  prompts:
  - WASD to walk!
  - Press Space to jump!
  - Jump then press Space again to start flying!
  - There's a few other pigeons you should go see!
  - Coobert will show you how to SNEAK around
  - Ruffle can tell you where to find food
  - Race Arnesto to test your skills!
  - 'Anytime you think you''re ready, you can take the Coober to Pigeonton Market! '
  - You can use E or X to ineract or speak with other pigeons
  - If you need to see the controls again you can find them in the PAUSE menu!
  promptIndex: 0
  canvasController: {fileID: 0}
